  "description": "(3.3.0) Plivo carrier adapter for CircleAI.Telephony. Number search + purchase, application/answer-url configuration, outbound dial with Audio Streaming, hang up, cold transfer — all via Plivo's v1 REST API (Basic auth). The host (CircleAI.Hosting.Telephony.Plivo) serves the AnswerUrl that returns the <Stream/> XML pointing to the per-call WebSocket. Fail-soft when credentials missing.",
